[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":92},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8},"item",{"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":-5,"_20":21,"_22":23,"_24":25,"_26":27,"_28":-5,"_29":30,"_31":25,"_32":33,"_34":35,"_36":37,"_38":39,"_40":41,"_42":-5,"_41":43,"_44":45,"_46":-5,"_47":-5,"_48":49,"_50":51,"_52":53,"_54":55,"_56":57,"_58":59,"_60":39,"_61":62,"_63":-5,"_64":39,"_65":66},"id","to97qksk2azu4dwx5t04i0qch","revision",1,"title","亚马逊卖家应重竞价轻结构","originalTitle","I think Amazon sellers overthink campaign structure and underthink bidding.","summary","我认为亚马逊卖家过度纠结于广告活动结构，却低估了竞价的重要性。\n\n平庸的结构配合优秀的竞价也能表现良好。\n\n精美的 SKW（广泛匹配）设置若竞价糟糕，依然会亏损。\n\n结构赋予你控制权。\n\n竞价决定了你为这种控制权支付的成本。\n\n显然两者都很重要。但如果我接手一个账户并需要快速优化，我通常会先审视竞价的经济学逻辑，再考虑重建所有内容。","reason","source",{"_9":85,"_86":87,"_88":89,"_90":39,"_91":-5},"links",{"_82":83,"_66":84},"publishedAt","2026-10-15T12:15:01.000Z","publishedPrecision","timestamp","calendarDate","discoveredAt","2026-10-17T15:58:17.554Z","timelineAt","category","advertising","tags",[80,81],"score",22,"selected",false,"channel","x","story",{"_71":72,"_73":51,"_74":75,"_76":77,"_78":-5,"_44":79},"media",[],"byline","detailedGuide","readingMode","full","author","Evan_Swanson_","language","en","body",{"_67":-5,"_66":68,"_69":-5,"_70":62},"outline",[],"relatedStories",[],"indexable","markdownAvailable",true,"group","hasTranslation","bodyLanguage","original","zh","<p>I think Amazon sellers overthink campaign structure and underthink bidding.</p><p>A mediocre structure with good bids can work pretty well.</p><p>A beautiful SKW setup with terrible bids still loses money.</p><p>Structure gives you control.</p><p>Bidding determines what you pay for that control.</p><p>Obviously both matter. But if I inherit an account and need to improve it fast, I’m usually looking at the economics of the bids before I start rebuilding everything.</p>","zhKind","complete","authorName","Evan Swanson","handle","avatarUrl","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","avatarSrcSet","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 48w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 96w","quoted",[],"广告/运营","广告投放","aihot","/items/to97qksk2azu4dwx5t04i0qch","https://x.com/Evan_Swanson_/status/2110706007265722416","x-evan-swanson","name","X · Evan Swanson","kind","x_search","firstParty","iconUrl",{"_93":94},"changelogVersion","2026-10-09T22:08"]
